                row("REQ-27", "Explicit answer to 'is that a state or local law?' in the forefront of the executive summary", "Published: LIC-11 to LIC-13 on the Executive Summary, Q-22/Q-23 on Questions & Answers, PRC-10/PRC-11 on the step-by-step page, LOC-26 to LOC-28 on Local Law and ST-18 to ST-20 on State Law - answer: LOCAL (SF Ord. No. 265-20, added Sec. 37.15, effective January 18, 2021; small buildings from March 1, 2023), while the 2023 state law (SB 567) amended the Civil Code caps and just-cause rules and imposes no rent-board filing for an increase", "verified", ["S53", "S88", "S89", "S36", "S90"], "Each of those rows links the ordinance text, the City news item, the Board of Supervisors attachment and the Civil Code sections."),
